/*
 * Implements validation for `assert` expressions in Ymir.
 *
 * An `assert` expression enforces a boolean condition at runtime or compile
 * time. Its behavior depends on whether the condition can be evaluated by the
 * compile-time interpreter.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::instruction::assert_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/instruction/assert_.yr
